# Step 90 — AI-exposure tests on margins the price index cannot see (EXPLORATORY)

Pages: 277,653 gig-quarters, 51,541 gigs, 2019Q4–2024Q4. Orders: 612,013, 2021Q4–2024Q4. Post = 1[quarter ≥ 2022Q4]. Exposure 0–1 (human = step-45 primary, GPT-4 = robustness), so a DiD coefficient is the post-ChatGPT change for a fully exposed vs an unexposed category. **Wild p (category)** is the wild-cluster bootstrap on 7 category clusters and is the inference to read; gig-clustered t is optimistic.

